        "seg_cer": 0.04,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他是靠自己勤劳的双手，脚踏实地的，都走上了脱贫致富的道路。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 10.598,
      "end": 14.389,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "而且呢成为了普立镇脱贫致富的攻坚模范。",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0095,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0081,
        "sc_delta": 0.0015,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "而且呢，成为了普利镇脱贫致富的攻坚模范。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.389,
      "end": 17.653,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "吴明富早年呢因为身患慢性疾病，",
      "score": 0.1,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1361,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1578,
        "sc_delta": -0.0217,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.13,
        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "吴明富早年呢，因为身犯慢性疾病。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 17.745,
      "end": 20.848,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他女呢又得了失血细胞综合症，",
      "score": 0.6255,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9016,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8757,
        "sc_delta": 0.0259,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.231,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "太女呢，又得了嗜血细胞综合征。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.848,
      "end": 26.127,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "生活就过得很艰难。吴明富两口子呢在屋里要照顾生病女，",
      "score": 0.317,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3028,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3124,
        "sc_delta": -0.0096,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.386,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "屋里",
        "text_free": "生活啊，就过得很艰难。吴明富两口子呢，在物流要照顾生病的女。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.127,
      "end": 31.043,
